{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krakenfang is a dark 3D fighting action game where you take on the role of a legendary pirate facing monsters rising from the depths of the sea. A cliffside town becomes the unforgiving arena, with wave after wave of enemies testing your skill, reflexes, and mastery of abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique enemy types, each with their own attacks and weaknesses, bring variety and danger to every encounter. The pirate\u2019s five powerful abilities allow you to shape your own playstyle: swift combos, crushing strikes, or calculated counters to shift the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no coincidences here \u2014 only your instincts, tactics, and will to survive the endless onslaught. The dark pirate atmosphere, crashing waves, and roaring beasts make every fight a living legend of survival on the edge of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic third-person 3D combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five unique enemy types with different tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five abilities to master and combine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wave-based system: increasing challenge with every round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric cliffside town as the battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000280?t=1757378749","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000280?t=1757378749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000280/33946fe2f210ef401aa9e4d123f58be552506f60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000280/33946fe2f210ef401aa9e4d123f58be552506f60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing"